                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>Reactivations: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>Number of reactivated users from Churned/Inactive/Lost segments, including reacquisitions. No HVA prioritization logic applied.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b8209c' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='12'>Run Rate Calculation Logic</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>Time Series Frocasting Model </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>  - </run>
