                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>  - Reactivations</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>Run Rate based on MTD&amp;Previous MTD </run>
